<title>SHARJAH: CRICKET-SRI LANKA BEAT PAKISTAN BY 19 RUNS IN SHARJAH CUP.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SRI LANKA BEAT PAKISTAN BY 19 RUNS IN SHARJAH CUP.</headline>
<dateline>SHARJAH, United Arab Emirates 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sri Lanka beat Pakistan by 19 runs in the Sharjah Cup cricket tournament on Friday.</p>
<p>Scores: Sri Lanka 243 for eight in 50 overs, Pakistan 224 for nine in 50 overs.</p>
</text>
